5. PRIMECORE SECURITY INTEGRATION
================================================================================

This Software is protected by PRIMECORE Security System from Smoothoperator:

5.1 ENCRYPTED VAULT STORAGE
Sensitive credentials and secrets are stored in GPG-encrypted vaults using
AES256 encryption with pinentry-mode loopback.

5.2 CREDENTIAL ISOLATION
All API keys, tokens, and sensitive data are:
  - Stored in encrypted .env files
  - Excluded from version control (.gitignore)
  - Protected by PRIME_GUARDIAN vault manager

5.3 WATERMARK ENFORCEMENT
All source files include mandatory copyright headers enforced by
PRIMECORE security policies.

